player-tui (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release v1.1.0
  - 16 accent colors + 17 border colors (including white)
  - Color cycling via 'u' (accent) and 'o' (border) keys
  - Footer keys always white
  - Abbreviated keybindings: Ant, Sig, Quit, Text, Edge
  - True transparency support
  - Persistent color preferences
  - Custom progress bar spanning full width

